  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0 (BREAKING): Browser interop moves from SpawnDev.BlazorJS to SpawnDev.SpawnJS across the whole dependency chain (SpawnDev.SpawnJS + SpawnDev.SpawnJS.Cryptography, and the SpawnJS builds of SpawnDev.RTC + SpawnDev.AsyncFileSystem). JS values cross the .NET/JS boundary as numeric object-table ids (no per-object JSObject allocation on the OPFS/piece hot paths). Client/torrent/wire API and desktop behavior unchanged; net10.0-only (SpawnJS is net10.0-only). See CHANGELOG.md.",
